@startuml SEQ_01_MENGELOLA_ASET
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12\nskinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-01: Mengelola Aset

actor       "Admin"                      as Admin
boundary    "Browser"                    as Browser
control     "InventarisController"       as CtrInv
control     "InventarisController" as CtrDet
entity      "Aset Model"           as ModelAset
entity      "KategoriAset Model"         as ModelKA
entity      "RiwayatKondisi Model"       as ModelRK
database    "aset"                as DB

== Lihat Daftar Aset ==

Admin   -> Browser  : Buka menu Inventaris
Browser -> CtrInv   : GET /inventaris
CtrInv  -> ModelAset  : Query aset berdasarkan lab
ModelAset -> DB       : SELECT aset WHERE lab_id = ?
DB      --> ModelAset : Data aset
CtrInv  -> ModelKA  : Query semua kategori
ModelKA -> DB       : SELECT kategori_aset
DB      --> ModelKA : Data kategori
CtrInv  --> Browser : Render halaman inventaris
Browser --> Admin   : Tampil daftar aset + filter + tombol CRUD

== Tambah Aset Baru ==

Admin   -> Browser  : Klik "Tambah Aset", isi form
Browser -> CtrDet   : POST /inventaris/aset
CtrDet  -> ModelAset  : create({nama, kategori_aset_id, kondisi, ...})
ModelAset -> DB       : INSERT INTO aset
DB      --> ModelAset : Data aset baru
CtrDet  -> ModelRK  : create({aset_id, kondisi, keterangan: 'Kondisi awal'})
ModelRK -> DB       : INSERT INTO riwayat_kondisi
DB      --> ModelRK : Berhasil
CtrDet  --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser --> Admin   : Aset baru muncul di daftar

== Edit Data Aset ==

Admin   -> Browser  : Klik "Edit", ubah data / ganti foto
Browser -> CtrDet   : PUT /detail-inventaris/{id}
CtrDet  -> ModelAset  : update({...data})
ModelAset -> DB       : UPDATE aset SET ... WHERE id = {id}
DB      --> ModelAset : Berhasil
CtrDet  --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser --> Admin   : Data aset ter-update

== Hapus Aset ==

Admin   -> Browser  : Klik "Hapus", konfirmasi
Browser -> CtrDet   : DELETE /detail-inventaris/{id}
CtrDet  -> ModelAset  : delete()
ModelAset -> DB       : DELETE FROM aset WHERE id = {id}
DB      --> ModelAset : Berhasil
CtrDet  --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser --> Admin   : Aset hilang dari daftar

@enduml
